// 加速道具（闪电，竖版）：吃到后冲刺约 5 秒——速度更快、无敌撞飞路障、磁铁吸金币

var (
	myLane  int
	z       float64
	bobT    float64
	inFront bool
)

onCloned data => {
	myLane = data.(int)
	z = ZFAR
	bobT = 0
	inFront = false
	setLayer Back
	show
	for state == 1 {
		if !frozen {
			if !frozen {
				z -= curSpeed
			}
		}
		bobT++
		s := pscale(z)
		setXYpos laneX(myLane)*s, groundYAt(z)+(26+6*float64(int(bobT/8)%2))*s
		setSize s
		if z <= HITZ && z > -40 && myLane == bullLane && jumpH < 80 {
			startBoost()
			// （不再冒“冲呀！”气泡，闪光和速度就是提示）
			deleteThisClone
		}
		if !inFront && z <= 0 {
			inFront = true
			setLayer Front
		}
		if z < -60 {
			deleteThisClone
		}
		waitNextFrame
	}
	for state == 2 {
		waitNextFrame
	}
	deleteThisClone
}
